  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "mls_dualcodec_pretokenize",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMultilingual LibriSpeech (English, \u226420s) \u2014 DualCodec pre-tokenized\n\t\n\nDualCodec (12 Hz) pre-tokenized speech for omni speech\u2013vision MLLM training.\nSource: MLS English.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tContents (train split)\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\nTotal samples\n\u2248 11,606,000 (audio\u2013transcript pairs)\n\n\nTotal audio\n\u2248 48,097 hours\n\n\nWebDataset shards\nsee repo (.tar)\n\n\nMean / median duration\n14.92s / 14.83s\n\n\np90 / max duration\n18.83s / 20.00s\n\n\nLength cap\n20s\n\n\n\t\n\nCounts/hours are computed by sampling shards\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/KU-AGI/mls_dualcodec_pretokenize.",
  "alternateName": [
    "KU-AGI/mls_dualcodec_pretokenize"
  ],
